   ],
   "text": "OD-B12-S07 on the rig desk. Each actor is a Subnet with one Minifig Rig: its generated choreography comes from assets/rig/OD-B12-S07/<actor>.json; the director's layer is the rig's own props (an offset per servo, a weight per body part), keyed in the Timeline against the Voice Track. Preview headless: cascade run rig-OD-B12-S07.cascade --frames 1-728 --fps 12. Export: node tools/rig_export.mjs OD-B12-S07."
  }
 ]
